93:T1-weighted scans from both the reference and ADNI data sets were processed using a mix of both FreeSurfer versions 5 and 6. Cortical thickness values were generated using the recon-all cross-sectional approach. 31 This cortical thickness algorithm calculates the mean distance between vertices of a corrected, triangulated estimated gray/white matter surface and gray matter/CSF (pial) surface, 32 which generated the cortical thickness of each region of the Destrieux atlas regions. 33 This included the mean cortical thickness and 148 regions cortical thickness values for each participant.
